<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.59 bln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.59 bln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bills auction on Tuesday compared to the August 27 auction  SUVK :</p>
<p>				This auction	Previous auction</p>
<p>				190-day T-bills   169-day T-bills</p>
<p> Av. yield, pct	   3.52 pct	    3.50 pct</p>
<p> Highest accepted	 3.52 pct	    3.50 pct</p>
<p> Lowest accepted	  3.51 pct	    3.49 pct</p>
<p> Amount, FIM million	  204		   260</p>
<p> Bids, million mk	     2,332		 621</p>
<p> Maturing date	    March 14, 1997    Feb 14, 1997</p>
<p>				This auction	Previous auction</p>
<p>				284-day T-bills   259-day T-bills</p>
<p> Av. yield, pct	   3.67 pct	    3.66 pct</p>
<p> Highest accepted	 3.67 pct	    3.66 pct</p>
<p> Lowest accepted	  3.67 pct	    3.65 pct</p>
<p> Amount, FIM million	  390		   500</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million	    2,007		 500</p>
<p> Maturing date	    June 16, 1997     May 15, 1997</p>
<p>				This auction	Previous auction</p>
<p>				344-day T-bills   351-day T-bills</p>
<p> Av. yield, pct	   3.75 pct	    3.84 pct</p>
<p> Highest accepted	 3.75 pct	    3.84 pct</p>
<p> Lowest accepted	  3.75 pct	    3.83 pct</p>
<p> Amount, million mk	   1,000		 643</p>
<p> Bids, million mk	     3,360		 1,568</p>
<p> Maturing date	    August 15, 1997   August 15, 1997</p>
<p>Total planned issue amount was 1.5 billion markka. After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 48,639 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
